        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "An urn with a lush naturalistic floral and fruit grouping, plus birds, on a white field. Above this appears, \"Ai genitor Ch' Amiamo/ Questo lavoro Offriamo\" (To the parent that I love this work I offer). Flanking below are \"Le. D. Granchio\" and \"Fec. Nel. 1831\"  Stylized floral vine border. Translucent and opaque glass plus gold colored metal beads. Couched repairs, missing and loose beads."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/c862a359-a340-395c-aeab-63ab471f3532> ;
